    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (+2)</em></p><p>While you wear these wraps, you have a +2 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with your Unarmed Strikes, and those strikes deal your choice of Force damage or their normal damage type.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-IZBnzRviInj0c3rA\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Empower Unarmed Strikes</em> enchante votre <em>Unarmed Strike</em> : +2 à l’attaque et aux dégâts, dégâts de Force au choix. Retirez l’enchantement quand vous ôtez les bandelettes.</p></section>",
